      "name": "Concrete generic Java field writes",
      "status": "supported",
      "scope": "Ordinary invariant concrete generic Java field signatures with matching logical and JVM field descriptors, including nullable platform lists, nested lists, maps and static writes. Assignment uses the existing type checker; ordinary compiled apply/aliased and arbitrary receiver functions keep their actual bytecode semantics.",
      "restrictions": [
        "Fields containing classifier type parameters, use-site projections or star projections remain explicit unsupported boundaries.",
        "Generic Java static field reads retain their previous unsupported boundary.",
        "No new receiver-scope-function lowering or function-name implementation is introduced."
      ]
    }
  ],
